Changes in DECIBEL: inference extracted from notebook into FastAPI modules;
bounded upload/decoder validation; browser codec support; new React frontend,
waveform rendering, microphone capture, API integration and visual design;
long-audio segmentation, quality diagnostics, conservative application-level
aggregation, region investigation, jobs/progress/cancellation, channel comparison,
independent batch analysis and JSON reports. Classifier weights are unmodified.
DECIBEL did not train the TrueVoice classifier. No endorsement is implied.
Gemma model weights are downloaded separately under their own terms.
